  "id": "posttraumatic-stress-disorder",
  "term": "posttraumatic stress disorder",
  "definition": "Posttraumatic stress disorder is a serious mental health disorder that can develop after intense psychological stress from catastrophic events or natural disasters. It commonly involves re-experiencing the trauma, increased alertness, and avoidance or emotional numbness, and it is often seen in people exposed to high-risk traumatic events.",
